  "NROOT" [label="(0,0,0) This study investigates the hypothesis that whole-brain imaging of c-Fos immediate-early gene expression, analyzed with explainable machine learning for compound classification, can support a scalable functional assay for screening psychedelic and related psychoactive compounds in preclinical drug-discovery contexts.", fillcolor="lightyellow", style="filled"];
